      "content": "To mitigate the risks associated with decentralization in crisis situations, we could implement additional redundancy and flexibility measures, such as implementing an \"edge-knows-hub\" architecture, where regional nodes maintain real-time visibility into inventory levels and order flows, allowing them to dynamically adjust their prioritization and coordination with other nodes. This hybrid model would enable efficient coordination across the network while still maintaining regional autonomy, rather than relying on a centralized orchestrator.",
